<mxCell id="p0-note" value="Built-in primary Catering service is provisioned idempotently; add-on services are dynamically named and behavior-driven. One canonical Food Item, globally available while food/category and target service are active. No assignment junction. Main Catering does not require Offerings or Serving Options; add-ons may use them. Package and individual listing publication plus Food Item images are implemented. Customer transactions remain deferred. See docs/19-commercial-refinement.md. Grouped listing options remain unfinished." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fefce8;strokeColor=#eab308;fontSize=17;align=left;spacing=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1352" width="2170" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram id="catalog-v3-2" name="02 Package Versions and Rules"><mxGraphModel dx="2040" dy="1800" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2040" pageHeight="1800"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
<mxCell id="w-product" value="&lt;b&gt;PRODUCTS (Package Products)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;id PK; family_id FK → Collections&lt;br/&gt;code immutable; name; description?&lt;br/&gt;active; archived_at?; sort_order&lt;br/&gt;creation_token? UNIQUE; creation_hash? CHAR(64)&lt;br/&gt;current_version_id? FK → Package Versions&lt;br/&gt;UNIQUE(family_id,code)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="60" width="430" height="270" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="w-version" value="&lt;b&gt;PACKAGE_VERSIONS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;id PK; package_product_id FK → Products&lt;br/&gt;family_id FK → Collections (same owner)&lt;br/&gt;version_number; draft_revision&lt;br/&gt;status: draft / published / abandoned&lt;br/&gt;cloned_from_id? FK → same-owner published version&lt;br/&gt;created_by; published_by?; abandoned_by? FK → Users&lt;br/&gt;published_at?; abandoned_at?&lt;br/&gt;published_snapshot? JSONB (immutable when published)&lt;br/&gt;base_price_minor BIGINT ≥ 0; currency PHP&lt;br/&gt;price_basis: per_pax / per_pack / per_set&lt;br/&gt;selection_policy: uniform / split&lt;br/&gt;total_selection_count? (shared package menu)&lt;br/&gt;minimum_quantity; quantity_step; maximum_quantity?&lt;br/&gt;estimated_capacity? (people per unit)&lt;br/&gt;subgroup_minimum?; subgroup_step?; subgroup_maximum?&lt;br/&gt;UNIQUE(package_product_id,version_number)&lt;br/&gt;one active draft per Package Product (partial UNIQUE)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="60" width="600" height="600" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="w-foods" value="&lt;b&gt;PACKAGE_VERSION_FOOD_ITEMS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;package_version_id PK/FK → Package Versions&lt;br/&gt;dish_id PK/FK → Dishes&lt;br/&gt;is_fixed; always_include (explicit fixed intent, including Main)&lt;br/&gt;included_quantity?; included_unit? (frozen configured unit label); price_adjustment_minor&lt;br/&gt;Portion amount/unit occur together; new labels resolve from active Measurement Units&lt;br/&gt;Main Catering: no measurements or premiums; fixed bundles: all fixed&lt;br/&gt;ownership immutable; Published children immutable" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="450" width="430" height="270" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="w-required" value="&lt;b&gt;PACKAGE_VERSION_REQUIRED_CATEGORIES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;package_version_id PK/FK → Package Versions&lt;br/&gt;category_id PK/FK → Dish Categories&lt;br/&gt;minimum_count; maximum_count&lt;br/&gt;maximum_count_explicit (legacy inheritance marker)&lt;br/&gt;CHECK 0 ≤ minimum_count ≤ maximum_count; maximum_count ≥ 1&lt;br/&gt;Single allowed Food Item becomes an Included Item&lt;br/&gt;ownership immutable; Published children immutable" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="800" width="430" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="w-groups" value="&lt;b&gt;SELECTION_GROUPS (Add-ons only)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;id PK; package_version_id FK → Package Versions&lt;br/&gt;group_code immutable; name; sort_order&lt;br/&gt;mode: fixed / select_one / select_many&lt;br/&gt;slot_kind: item/rice/drink/dish/lechon/tray/bundle_item&lt;br/&gt;minimum_count; maximum_count; unique_dishes&lt;br/&gt;category_mode: free / restricted&lt;br/&gt;inclusion_count NUMERIC &gt; 0&lt;br/&gt;UNIQUE(package_version_id,group_code)&lt;br/&gt;UI: Included Items / Customer Choices" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="800" width="600" height="360" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="w-options" value="&lt;b&gt;GROUP_OPTIONS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;id PK; group_id FK → Selection Groups&lt;br/&gt;offering_option_id FK → Offering Options&lt;br/&gt;is_default; price_adjustment_minor BIGINT ≥ 0&lt;br/&gt;UNIQUE(group_id,offering_option_id)&lt;br/&gt;Frozen at publication:&lt;br/&gt;snapshot_dish_id FK; snapshot_category_id FK&lt;br/&gt;snapshot_dish_name; snapshot_category_name&lt;br/&gt;snapshot_offering_name; snapshot_option_code&lt;br/&gt;snapshot_option_label; snapshot_unit&lt;br/&gt;snapshot_quantity NUMERIC&lt;br/&gt;snapshot_serving_pax?; snapshot_serving_claim?&lt;br/&gt;Ownership immutable; only Draft children editable" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="60" width="600" height="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
